  "result": "# Bloodbound Earrings 37.0.2 acquisition revision\n\nBG32_MagicItem_808 acquisition cost changes from 1 to 2. Historical RAW/compiled rows and the existing four-spell Blood Gem effect are preserved. Exact current-row validation is required on the actual discover offer before payment, rejecting copied-field corruption without changing the live game.\n\nFormal headless run_1 exited 0 in 209.08 seconds under 4 GiB/600-second limits. Independent JSON evidence audit passed: 32 legal commands including eight replay commands, seven exact native save/load checkpoints, seven corrupt-offer rejections, and eight source-negative checks. Both owners paid exactly 2 gold; four native Banana casts advanced progress 1/2/3/0 and the fourth applied one Gem to each of two friendly minions. Runtime fingerprint: eb343276b0541964fcf482d244113e6af104730a789c7e2777e53129f5cc7128. Report SHA256: 4b38de9882706019595b951f01024e438ff24ba78b410ac8fbd5078611c9285c. No broad completion, default-pool availability, new effect, or exhaustive regression claim is made.\n\nScenario: public CustomShop with two existing minions overridden to tier1/cost0/copies12, native Bananas, real round-six offers for two owners, four casts and per-friendly Gem checks. Save/load and exact replay are checked over all thirteen snapshot fields. Seven corrupt offers and eight copied invalid source rows are negative-only probes.\n\nLimits: not the natural full pool; no one-gold insufficient-funds branch, automatic cast compositions, multiple slots, second cycle, combat compositions, or full regression suite. Previous partial/hold boundaries remain in place. No upload performed.\n"
